  "imageName": "questionmark.circle",
  "intro": "Building on B1 aspect lessons and B2 aspect nuances, we now examine how aspect in questions reveals what information you're seeking. EXPERIENCE questions use imperfective: Ты читал эту книгу? (Have you read it - ever?). COMPLETION questions use perfective: Ты прочитал книгу? (Did you finish it?). REQUESTS differ too: Ты будешь есть? (Will you eat? - open question) vs Ты съешь это? (Will you eat THIS? - specific). INVITATIONS typically use imperfective for politeness. Understanding this helps you ask exactly what you mean.",
  "rules": [
    "Experience questions use impf - Ты смотрел этот фильм? (Have you ever seen?)",
    "Completion questions use pf - Ты посмотрел фильм? (Did you finish watching?)",
    "Open-ended questions use impf - Что ты будешь делать? (What will you be doing?)",
    "Specific action questions use pf - Ты позвонишь ему? (Will you call him?)"
  ],
  "examples": [
    "Ты читал Толстого? (Have you ever read Tolstoy?, experience)",
    "Ты прочитал книгу, которую я дал? (Did you finish the book I gave you?)",
    "Что ты будешь пить? (What will you have to drink?, open choice)",
    "Ты выпьешь кофе? (Will you have coffee?, specific offer)"
  ],
